OL,3,AThree men jailed for 158 years each for
OL,4,Amurdering Australian and US surfers in
OL,5,AMexico
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Mexican judge has sentenced three men
OL,8,Fconvicted of murdering Australian
OL,9,Fbrothers Jake and Callum Robinson and
OL,10,Ftheir US friend Carter Rhoad to 158
OL,11,Fyears and nine months in jail each.
OL,13,FThe Robinsons and Rhoad were killed in
OL,14,Fan apparent botched robbery of their
OL,15,Ftruck on a secluded beach in Baja
OL,16,FCalifornia in 2024 while they were on a
OL,17,Fsurfing trip, the court heard during
OL,18,Fthe trial.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
